// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Administrator_Chen 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 33 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Administrator Chen 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4092576297" "Administrator Chen"
// ProfessionString :
"P3114485112" "First Ward Administrator"
// DescriptionString :
"P856364347" ""
// LocationString :
"P4126942196" "First Ward"
// HelloString :
"P2257465555" "There is much to be done today, HeroName.  We can not maintain a utopian society by condoning a lack of dedication, thus we shall have to lead by example.  Let us begin."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P314907421" "I find that conversation with no purpose does not benefit.  I will not allow myself to mislead you into believing that I 'like' or 'dislike' you.  Until you have a reason for speaking with me, do not bother me again."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2243902364" "Remove the cancer in your heart that you call feelings and you will see the world through a clearer mind.  My name is Casey Chen, but you may call me Administrator Chen, and know that I view this world with extreme clarity.  It is my task to oversee the personnel that maintain the working operations of the First Ward.  We face many difficulties in this part of the city, which is why I have been put in charge of these operations.  You see, we need to react at a moments notice to aberrations in Hamidon's behavior.  Rational decisions lead to success.  Emotionally reacting to a situation, however, will leads irrevocable failure."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2395574474" "I have no immediate need of your skills at this time, {HeroName}.  If I find a need, I will contact you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1241607110" "You have overburdened yourself with tasks.  Your over eagerness needs to be tempered.  Finish what you are doing then speak with me again."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2329535048" "I can not use someone like you at this time, for your skills are subpar.  Return once this fact has changed, say at Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2799562939" "I need to stay in more immediate contact with you due to the efficiency you've shown.  I will assume a person such as you is still susceptible to greed, yes?  Then let that be your motivator."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1462709038" "You have performed your tasks as they were given to you.  I will note that in the future if more specialized help is needed.  I warn you not to feel pride in your actions, or that will be noted additionally."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P1649414996" "I don't trust your motives, {HeroName}."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1667030216" "I'm unsure what we have to discuss."
// IntroString :
"P612594318" "There's someone I want you to meet.  Here is their contact information.  I think you would be inclined to work with them."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3751841202" "Meet New Contact"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2022483603" "This contact I've introduced you to can probably move you along down the path you've chosen."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2557049975" "I've got someone I think you should meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P799934329" "There's a couple of people you should talk to."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


