// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Blind_Makwa 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 33 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Blind Makwa 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1581026090" "Blind Makwa"
// ProfessionString :
"P2523758555" "Blind Spirit Walker"
// DescriptionString :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P2590057850" "You've come at the time that you are needed, {HeroName}.  Your role in the upcoming events has been shaped by those that have come before you and those that will come after you."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3979707426" "You come looking for sights that your eyes are not ready for, {HeroName}.  Come back to me when I can see you clearer."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4107467612" "Your eyes are where your blindness begins, {HeroName}.  To close your eyes is to allow your sight to expand.  I see much now, {HeroName}, so do not pity me for my blindness as I pity you for yours.  As part of the Great Spirit, I shall help you through your blindness.<br> <br>Around you are many souls that can not move on.  Some of them blame you, {HeroName}.  But these souls are angry, some are confused, and some are sad.  I will guide you as the eyes of the Great Spirit and help you to send these souls to their deserved rest."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2071035436" "We will meet again, {HeroName}, but now is not the time.  You have been guided by my sight in the past, and there will be one more time you will need my vision.  Do not be sad on that day, {HeroName}."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2002824300" "You bear burdens of others so much that the Great Spirit can not touch you.  Unload your burdens so that you can let the Spirit guide your sight."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1735870140" "You do not see enough yet, {HeroName}.  Once you have opened your eyes and seen new levels of vision... that is when you will need to return to me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3120429245" "The Great Spirit sees only the truth, and speaks in ways that can not be heard.  We may now speak through the Spirit."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3981691971" "Many of your angry souls now have found peace through your actions, {HeroName}.  Not all are gone, but they know that you are beginning to see as I can."
// WrongAllianceString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


