// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Mother_Mayhem 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 33 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Mother Mayhem 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2013985415" "Mother Mayhem"
// ProfessionString :
"P4187044497" "Praetor and Asylum Warden"
// DescriptionString :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P549942183" "Ohhhh... you've come back to Mother!  I've missed you, HeroName.  Why were you gone so long?  You weren't being bad were you?  Were.  YOU?!  WERE YOU BEING BAD?  Ohhh... shush... it's alright.  Mother knows you weren't."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3913460941" "I did not come calling for you, my little one.  When I call you, you'll feel it and do as Mother says."
// FirstVisitString :
"P302905985" "It's so good to finally meet you, {HeroName}.  When I first heard about you, I knew you were just like one of my children.  Since then, I've so missed you and have wanted to hold you to my bosom, like a precious little child.  Why are you looking at me that way, {HeroName}?  Are you doubting me?  Are you doubting your precious mother?!  Are you?!   You worthless little ingrate!  I will have your mind flayed for thinking those THINGS ABOUT ME!<br> <br>No... no.  You're just scared, aren't you?  You've never felt someone love you as much as I have.  Mother understands.  Shush-shush... I would never hurt you, my little genius.  I wouldn't hurt you because I know you want in your heart to help me, don't you?  Don't you?!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2451315002" "Mother doesn't need any thing from you right now, but thank you for asking.  But I thought you knew that.  Are you trying to sneak something past me?  Are you?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2464806358" "When I ask you to do something, I am NOT asking you.  I am TELLING YOU.  You will drop what other things you're doing and DO WHAT MOTHER TELLS YOU!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3802417943" "No, no, dear.  I'm not going to put you in harm's way by asking you to do this little thing for me.  I would never harm a hair on my children's head, now would I?  WOULD I!?"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4149381035" "You've done such a good job, {HeroName}.  I knew you would do it.  Didn't I say you could?  But you didn't believe me, did you?  DID YOU?!  YOU DIDN'T BELIEVE MOTHER, DID YOU?! From now on, I want to keep an eye on where you are.  You are not leaving mother's sight, no matter where you go.  Do you understand?!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2671586399" "You have done your mother proud, {HeroName}.  You always were my favorite, you know that right?  RIGHT?!"
// WrongAllianceString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


