// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Nadia_Umbala 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 33 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Nadia Umbala 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3737854071" "Nadia Umbala"
// ProfessionString :
"P244901103" "Seer"
// DescriptionString :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P2251977988" "You come back to ol' Nadia just like the spirits say you would.  They also tell me what is on your mind, chil'.  But you need to say it to me, so speak, chil'."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P64443129" "No, no, no, chil'.  The spirits say it is not time for you to speak to me.  You need to know that you want answers.  Then you come back to me, okay?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P3351906408" "You come to ol' Nadia for answers, don't you chil'?  Well Nadia has those answers, but she don't think you know what the questions are.  The answers walk among us, they see everything.  You just know how to ask.  You gotta know what questions to say.  I have asked, and they have said that you, {HeroName}, want to know about the First Ward.  Well, chil', I'll show you.  But you will need to steel yourself, for what you will see may make you never see the world the same way again."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2631718695" "Ol' Nadia has no more answers for you, chil'.  You need to find your own answers by letting the spirits guide you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P939696250" "You got too many things you doing right now, chil'.  You take care of those, then you come ask ol' Nadia what you want to know."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1896060408" "No, no, no, chil'.  You need to know a lot more about this world before I can show you what lies underneath.  You come back to me when you're able to handle what I show you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2271813254" "The spirits that see everything say that you are needed here in the First Ward.  You will need me to achieve your destiny, so you stay in close contact and ask ole Nadia anything you need."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1074762461" "The spirits say you are closer to what it is that you need to do, but they don't say what it is.  That is a good sign, {HeroName}.  I am glad you came to ol' Nadia for answers."
// WrongAllianceString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
