// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Penelope Yin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3268873349" "Penelope Yin"
// ProfessionString :
"P2208686996" "Ghostly Voice"
// DescriptionString :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P3613110016" "A young woman's voice sings into your mind,'I see a face I do not know, and still I wish them welcome. But if evil stirs inside their heart, then I bid they leave me lonesome'."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3033578782" "Someone's thoughts become your own, 'You I have no memory of, so my thoughts they will not flow. Through face and voice you recognize, return to those you know'."
// FirstVisitString :
"P609050181" "A rhyming verse forms in your thoughts, though they are not your own, 'There is a shadow growing, consuming what is good. So find it strange you may well say, that I hide not where you would. Innocence is my sole defense, from the eyes upon my thoughts. By rhyme and song I reach out to you, and so disguise my plots'."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2606138898" "A lullaby slowly fills your mind, 'Now I sleep and lie in wait, for the coming of the dawn. For in that light, hope will grow, and fear will soon be gone'."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3464816162" "A soft song springs into your mind, 'I sense in you a will that's strong, and wishes to do right. But such a will, while welcome here, is already in the fight. Once your battle scars have healed, and your will still burns as strong. Come back to me and listen well, for I'll have for you a song'."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1591198680" "A rhyme springs from memory, but you have never heard it, 'Your strength to fight is without question, but your will is greater still. When your strength and will are matched, a rhyme for you I'll trill'."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3533696475" "You feel warmth in your heart as a woman's words speak to your mind, 'I extend to you my embrace, thought mental it remains. In you I see a truest friend, a friend who shares my pain'."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2857537197" "The woman's voice sings joyously in your thoughts, 'You have shown me that I placed my trust within one whom fights a cause that's just. Together we can paint a dream that Mother cannot touch'."
// WrongAllianceString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
