// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : OLD_Randal_Hastings 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 33 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Randal Hastings 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1453699595" "Randal Hastings"
// ProfessionString :
"P2240363806" "Mental Professor"
// DescriptionString :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P3860289516" "I'm not entirely certain you being here is a coincidence.  Rather than suspect the reasons for your appearance, I'll use every moment of this opportunity.  In other words, I'm glad to see you."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P271602658" "I'm sorry, friend, but I'm not taking on any students right now."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3351411911" "It's a pleasure to meet you, {HeroName}.  My name is Randal Hastings, and I offer my help to anyone who finds that their mind contains powers outside of their control.  Rather than being afraid of themselves, I teach telepaths that they have a gift that can be used for the betterment of mankind.  I have recently been granted a new lease on life when one of my students surpassed her teacher and re-awakened my own powers.  Now it is time for me to do my part to change the world!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3872672980" "There is so much to do right now.  Rashly jumping at the first thing, however, is a clear path to failure.  When I've chosen the best course of action, I'll be sure to let you know."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3099539910" "Although it would be a pleasure to work with you, HeroName, it seems that you're too busy right now.  Please stop by again when you have more time available."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3044427279" "The assistance that I need from you would require you to much more power at your disposal.  Please come back to me when you're a tad bit more capable of handling problems."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2235823738" "Remember, when people put their heads together, anything is possible.  From hereon, let us stay in contact mentally, shall we?"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P621763061" "Ms. Yin was the person who showed me that I wasn't powerless.  You, {HeroName}, have re-affirmed that feeling."
// WrongAllianceString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : OLD_Seer_1381 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 33 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Seer 1381 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1132683138" "Seer 1381"
// ProfessionString :
"P3963046469" "Unwilling Seer"
// DescriptionString :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P2120254190" "I'm not allowed to talk with anyone that Mother doesn't prove of.  So I'll do what makes Mother happy and not talk with the person in front of me."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P4014988703" "I hear someone talking to me.  They sound like they are standing next to me, but they can't be.  I can hear that they don't know me, so they can't be talking to me."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2755979231" "So many events happen in this city every moment, and I am given the privilege of hearing them.  Always, always hearing them, all the time, always and always.  Mother says I am so happy to hear them, so I am.  I'm listening to the person in front of me right now and can hear what they want to hide from other people.  People like me.  But I can hear.  I always hear."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2213528179" "Someone is thinking they're broken.  They think that they can now be fixed, for the real Mother and the real father loves her.  They think they're getting better."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1477449009" "I hear so many people wanting to do more things than they can handle.  They are wondering out loud if they need to complete their important tasks before taking on more."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2291949333" "I hear doubt from people who think they can't accomplish a task.  It is very sad, because they are right.  But they don't know they will come back later when they can."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2105942024" "A person in front of me is wondering if I will talk with them from far away.  They don't know they're right."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P186378532" "I hear someone saying that they trust the person they are talking to won't let anyone hurt them.  I now hear that person talking is me."
// WrongAllianceString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


