// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : OLD_Weaver 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 33 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Weaver 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2231134887" "Weaver"
// ProfessionString :
"P2870124161" "Predictor"
// DescriptionString :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P629759291" "Well, this one is a no-brainer.  It's quite obvious, judging by everything I've been able to observe of you, that you're talking to me right now for the sole reason that you're interested in helping our cause.  Am I right?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2241343760" "Though I don't know you specifically, I can definitely say I know what kind of person you are.  And I also know that if a friendship is pushed too hard, you're the kind of person that would be rebuffed by that.  I think it's in your best interests if I don't talk with you right now."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2177576529" "Before you even begin talking, let me tell you a little about myself, okay?  I don't want you to get defensive when you start seeing that I'm right about everything.  Ugh.  And something like that is going to put you on the defensive.  I really need to watch it before pointing out things like how I know you better than you know yourself.<br> <br>People call me the Weaver because I'm able to see through the tangled skein of people's actions and motivations.  I know they really call me that because they think I'm some kind of spider that is ready to strike at any moment.  It's only natural for a person to be jealous of the way in which I'm able to piece together events and judge people accurately.  Once they find out I don't even have any powers other than a super-intelligent brain, the jealousy increases.  So, to let you know, you don't have to be jealous of me, okay?  Now, let's get down to business."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3681388179" "I don't have anything else right now that I need your help with.  Please don't take that as an attack against your self-worth.  This is just a situational thing."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2437293058" "You're trying to overcompensate for an unknown insecurity by over-extending yourself.  Once you have a more manageable load of tasks is when I can ask anything more of you."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3075732634" "Your eagerness to help is noted, HeroName.  However, the task I have for you would require more strength than you have.  I know you want to do it, but I can't knowingly set you up for failure."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P247078409" "Since we've been working together, you're getting to a point that you need to feel appreciated for your actions.  Thus, I'm now giving you a compliment and also a gesture of trust by giving you my cell phone number."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P936340941" "You'll be needing recognition of your accomplishments about now.  Here it is, ready? {HeroName}, you have done a very good job.  I'm certain you are now feeling better."
// WrongAllianceString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


