// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : P_BlindMakwa 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Blind Makwa 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
// ProfessionString :
"P2622505953" "Medicine Man"
// DescriptionString :
"P882263654" "Blind Makwa was born without sight like normal men. He was gifted with the rare and beautiful ability to see spirits as others see one another every day. It was this reason that he became a well respected medicine man. His ability to converse with those who had taken the heaven's road and joined with the great spirit was sought by many in the wake of the Hamidon Wars. But dead men are supposed to tell no tales, and so when Blind Makwa began hearing terrible truths, he snuck away to the First Ward where he would be safe, and no one would look for him."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P2116187179" "I cannot reveal my secrets to you at this time.<br><br><color orange>You must become a VIP or purchase the First Ward from the Paragon Market in order to access this contact."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P767994668" "I do not need eyes to hear you, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P3769826929" "I know that smell... {HeroName}, you've returned."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P108170969" "I am speaking to the wind, and they have nothing to say about you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4046277497" "I have heard your name on the winds, {HeroName}. Oh, do not be alarmed, the winds do not speak to just anyone. I talk with them, and they talk with me. We share many old stories - stories I used to share with the dead - until that witch stole my sight. Now I talk, and listen, but my friends, the spirits of those who have passed, are gone. I only have the winds now to keep me company. The winds and the fish, and sometimes the Carnival comes to visit, but seldom to hear my stories. Perhaps you have come for stories as well, but I suspect you seek knowledge of the spirits, like all the others."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3675690664" "I am afraid I can do nothing more with you, {HeroName}. The spirit wards should keep us safe from these Apparitions. If ever you should find the witch that stole my sight, I would be grateful to have it returned to me. Thank you, and safe travels, brave one."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P594309058" "Your mind is conflicted and the winds bind around you in knots. You must choose a direction to go and head that way or you will circle endlessly trying to go every direction at once. Once you have focus, come and talk to me, then your mind may be clear enough for what I need you to do."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1928339781" "I am communing with the spirits now. Come back later."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1245226437" "The laws of the spirit realm aren't so different from our own. There is, however, one rule that the dead must obey, and that is that the dead cannot change. But the living exist to do exactly this; <i>everything</i> we do causes change. The wind brought you to me as a wanderer, {HeroName}, but now you are a friend."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3181699503" "When the inevitable happens, {HeroName}, I would like us to be friends beyond even the grave. You will always be in my thoughts and in my prayers."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P1402061461" "Blind Makwa's pretty cool for a crazy old blind guy. Sits around Mercyview and talks to ghosts all day long. And he must be some kind of force to be reckoned with because <i>nobody</i> messes with him. He told me he was a 'medicine man', whatever that means. Hopefully, he's got the cure we need for First Ward."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3773279096" "Travel well on this path and do well to mind each and every pebble; even the smallest can cause ripples on a distant shore or find its way into the bottom of your shoe."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1586396271" "Cerulean is a member of the Carnival, you can find him at the Chapel of Enduring Light in the Mercyview Cemetery."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


