// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : P_Cerulean 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Cerulean 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2238115225" "Cerulean"
// ProfessionString :
"P1471267390" "Surviving Midnighter"
// DescriptionString :
"P3673714629" "Cerulean is a wizard with no compunctions about openly displaying his signature shade of blue to all. He is a man who held great stature in the Midnight Squad of old, but after its fall he was but one of the few survivors seeking solace, and finding it with Vanessa DeVore and her Carnival of Light. Cerulean has made it no secret that he wants to lead the Carnival to war against their adversaries, and as such he has gathered numerous like-minded individuals, many of them former Midnighters as well, to his side. So far the Carnival of War stays leashed to Vanessa DeVore's blessing, but with the changes in First Ward coming, it is only a matter of time before war finds them. Cerulean stands ready for that day."
// InteractionRequiresText :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P4270618316" "Our enemies never rest, and neither shall we."
// HelloString :
"P4210816276" "One must not always make war, but one should always be prepared for it."
// HelloString :
"P1689189851" "I am prepared to die to destroy evil, there are worse things than death."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1496059527" "People rarely seek out a wizard without cause. Find a cause worthy of me and then we will speak, until then you should not meddle with the affairs of wizards."
// FirstVisitString :
"P78226936" "There are few things more terrible to behold than a wizard prepared for war, {HeroName}, and believe me, this is a war we are in. Whether DeVore and the rest of the Carnival wishes to acknowledge it or not, our enemies are many and will do unspeakable evil to destroy us. But I do not worry. Despite all of their ferocious power our adversaries lack one critical element...<br><br>You."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1493633066" "The evil we face is too powerful for you at this time, {HeroName}. Grow your power, train yourself in the ways of battle, and then we shall talk."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1176610279" "I feel I can trust in you, {HeroName}. Take this bead. If you ever need to talk to me, just think of me and we can share our thoughts. Across space, across time, even across dimensions."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4286561569" "You show courage in the face of death. I could ask nothing more than to have such a brave friend to stand at my side."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P1809579296" "Cerulean is a powerful wizard, but you have already seen that for yourself. He has great knowledge of the past and the present. Together you will work to calm the fire in the hearts of the spirits who are shrouded by evil's veil."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1962389143" "Trust Master Midnight if you wish, but I warn you, he will betray you as he did me."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4091158611" "I can sense Master Midnight's presence atop the Westerman Building."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NoTasksRemaining 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Phased Text :
"P654042451" "<color orange>You're unable to reach Cerulean.</color>"
// Page NotPhased Text :
"P3579352235" "The evil that the Carnival of Light hoped to contain has been freed, {HeroName}, and now I must prepare the Carnival for war."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - PlayerBusy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page NotPhased Text :
"P1583296524" "You cannot fight a war on so many fronts, {HeroName}. You must finish off your enemies before looking for new ones."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


