// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : P_Diabolique 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Diabolique 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1570668787" "Diabolique"
// ProfessionString :
"P3684144844" "Disembodied Arcanist"
// DescriptionString :
"P4014403146" "A spirit bound to this world through magic, Diabolique is a cruel and petty woman who is interested only in gathering more power no matter who gets hurt. Everyone who is anyone in First Ward seems to have crossed her path at one point or another and left with a lasting and bitter impression of her."
// InteractionRequiresText :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P1580481853" "Life is fleeting, but death is forever."
// HelloString :
"P466098671" "What can you do for me, {HeroName}?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3599988781" "This vortex is of far more interest than your insignificant whims or desires. If I have need of you then <i>I</i> will find you. Until then, test my patience no more. Now begone!"
// FirstVisitString :
"P3806090805" "You look upon death herself, {HeroName}. Chose your next words wisely."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P524195031" "I have no need for your crude physical shell; it is your essence, your soul, your eternal being which draws my eye. Careful, {HeroName}. Grow too tempting and I will take your soul... for all eternity."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2889482199" "We all have things that are more important to do, it seems. For example, this vortex appears to be a gate to the nether world where thousands of souls are pushing through the thin veil between that world and this one. It is a wellspring of power that I am quite happy to enjoy tapping for some time. Come back when you have less on your mind."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P62627504" "Your power is insufficent for my needs. Grow stronger and then we'll see how best you can serve me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P512973298" "You show potential and initiative, two qualities that the dead generally lack. I can use you for a spell longer than I initially anticipated."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P229682219" "Together we can accomplish much. Continue to prove yourself to me and I will make certain that you are by my side for all time."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


