// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : P_KatieDouglas 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Katie Douglas 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1078912095" "Katie Douglas"
// ProfessionString :
"P3310865491" "Renegade Seer"
// DescriptionString :
"P2545594958" "Katie Douglas is an ex-seer who escaped from the Seer Network and the authorities in Imperial City and then made her way to First Ward. She has worked tirelessly toward freeing other Seers and has enjoyed limited success here. To accomplish that feat, however, she has had to lie low and choose her allies very carefully. The Resistance sees her as nothing more than a weapon--politically and  literally--and the Loyalists would just as soon place her back into the Network for another 15 years."
// InteractionRequiresText :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P1698507310" "<b>*sigh*</b><br><br>What's up?"
// HelloString :
"P400744214" "Spit it out already."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P111597095" "Yeah, so I could read your mind to find out how you found me, but I might get the notion to do something worse. Back away and forget you ever saw me."
// FirstVisitString :
"P465551077" "{HeroName}, guess what? A package arrived in the mail today. It's all the intel you gathered on the <color red>Awakened</color> and the <color red>Apparitions</color> from <color red>D.U.S.T.</color> Oh, and by 'mail', I meant I recently <i>read your mind</i> and downloaded the bits I needed. Cool? Cool.<br><br>So what we know is that the Asylum sent a D.U.S.T. cell to retrieve some of 'her special children' from the Sunken City. We <i>don't</i>  know how these 'special childen' AKA 'the Awakened' got there in the first place. But they <b>were</b> recovered and brought to ARCLIGHT, and that's when things lost the plot. The Awakened went crazy, some of them mind-controlling the D.U.S.T. Rangers inside, and others fleeing to other parts of the Free-Fire Zone - and almost always accompanied by the Apparitions. And then there's some hogwash about medical records at BETTERMOUSETRAP that got you nowhere. Sound about right? Whatever, it's close enough and I'm tired of talking. Moving on."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3745538744" "I'm busy. Go bug someone else."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3320457621" "This is gonna be a long road for us, killer. And I really don't want to be seen tagging along with you. Not physically, anyway. But if you need to reach me, just scream my name really loud in your head. Really, really loud. It'll be annoying enough that I'll probably answer."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2408056837" "Okay, so we <i>should</i>  talk about how things went twenty kinds of crazy when you drew all those Apparitions to my house and all my friends got killed...but I totally don't feel like it.<br><br>But now <b>I</b> know what being possessed can do to someone, and it's...<i>not</i>  cool.<br><br>Look. I'll stop calling you 'killer' from here on out. Fair? Fair. And that's about as good as it's ever going to get between us, <i>{HeroName}</i>."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P1594730034" "Look, {HeroName}, Katie Douglas is a bit of a...problem child. I know, I shouldn't judge, right? But if the stories are true, her psychic powers and her history have left her a bit <i>unhinged</i> and, no, I don't care if you're still telepathically-eavesdropping on us, Katie. Anyhow, {HeroName}, keep an eye on her, okay? We need her on <i>our</i> side."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P610496699" "Well, look at that. She was listening all along.<br><br><i>Psychics.</i> You can find her near the Sunken City."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1151585756" "Whenever you're ready to find the blind guy, I'll telesend you his location."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NoTasksRemaining 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Phased Text :
"P756395394" "<color orange>You're unable to reach Katie Douglas.</color>"
// Page NotPhased Text :
"P1610109189" "This is where we part ways, {HeroName}. I don't need anything else from you, m'kay? It's really been a riot, but it's time for you to bother someone else."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - PlayerBusy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page NotPhased Text :
"P1907941847" "Yeahhh...see, I need someone who can focus, {HeroName}. Your mind is racing with all the stuff you've agreed to do and how to put it all in order. I'm not going to help with that, and I'm certainly not going to add to it. Come back when you've got your house in order."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


