// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : P_MasterMidnight 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Master Midnight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1768114360" "Master Midnight"
// ProfessionString :
"P68101713" "Dark Lord of the Midnight Masters"
// DescriptionString :
"P1754513476" "The Midnight Master himself, Master Midnight wrestled control over the Midnight Squad and their Midnight Mansion many moons ago. Those who he has defeated have become slaves to his power, serving him even beyond death as the undead Midnight Masters. Though despite all his power, Master Midnight lacks true knowledge of magic, a gap he is working feverishly to close in the hopes of obtaining the affections of Diabolique."
// InteractionRequiresText :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P1297749470" "Don't worry, you don't need to bow in my presence."
// HelloString :
"P655139904" "I've been looking forward to unleashing my raw awesome power."
// HelloString :
"P255588496" "I'm ready for adventurer, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P1174967115" "They tell me that's awe you are feeling in my presence. I've never felt it so I can't say with any authority, but you'll get used to it in time."
// HelloString :
"P4122614923" "All I want is to be both feared and loved. Is that so much to ask?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1950209698" "Listen. I know that you heard that 'Master Midnight' was up here, and that 'you’re a big fan' and all, but I am really quite busy and can't meet with just anyone. I have a number of, um, parties that I'm, um, hosting, and frankly we just don't have room for another player, er, guest. No hard feelings? Cool."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2423176050" "Sweeping cape motion, 'whoosh!' Cue lightning flash and a clap of thunder, 'Crash-boom!' Then the choir, 'Ah Ah Ah! Ah! Ah Ah Ah! Ah! Ahhhhhh! Ahhhhh! AAAAAAH!'<br><br>I am the Magnificent <color red>Master Midnight</color>... ...and I am Master of the Midnight Mast... er... s...<br><br>Wow, that sounded way better in my head.<br><br>Irrelevent! I have come to save the world and the delicate wallflower of love that is my Diabolique. My beautiful, delightful, sensitive, caring Diabolique, who has been taken by, by... by that equally striking, seductive, cunning, and enchanting vixen, <color red>Sorceress Serene</color>!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1858695844" "No no no... No. I am not running a low level campaign here, people. The horrors you will face in my battle to save the world and rescue the beautiful Diabolique would destroy you with a mere glance. You have to gain more power. Only then will I take you on as my hireling."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3033494064" "There is a bond that binds warriors together, {HeroName}. It is stronger than steel, harder than stone, and more potent than any magic. You and I share that bond, {HeroName}. I now consider you... my retainer. I know, it's a very emotional moment for me as well. Carry that title proudly, {HeroName}, you have earned it."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2278297341" "{HeroName}. Fate, it seems, has brought us together. If EVER you are in need, know this; there will always be a place for you in my party."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P3299165385" "So, Master Midnight still holds a torch for Diabolique... What a pity he could not arrive in time to save her. That fool will end up her slave one way or another. While I would normally find a fitting end for such a traitor, in this case it would mean that the souls of my fellow Midnighters would belong to her as well. Perhaps you can find a way to get close enough to Midnight to betray him before he betrays you. That would be a worthy use of your time with him, if you ask me."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2553578456" "Vanessa is waiting for you in the Mercyview Cemetery. How mysterious and enticing it is of her to pick a graveyard as her locale of choice."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P884965987" "Oh,  I envy you, {HeroName}. What I wouldn't do to be invited to work side by side with such a lovely specimen of the female variety as Vanessa DeVore. Perhaps you could put in a good word with her for me?"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NoTasksRemaining 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Phased Text :
"P1566827058" "<color orange>You're unable to reach Master Midnight.</color>"
// Page NotPhased Text :
"P1631411374" "Alas! We must part ways here, {HeroName}. Our quest demands it of us. Though my immense intellect and vast resources would no doubt be of greater use in the battles that you must face, my talents are of even greater use in discovering the weaknesses of our foes. But fear not! When times are darkest and the final hour draws near, look for me and I will be there. My timely arrival at the pivotal moment of the final battle you will most certainly be imperilled in will grant me final victory!<br><br>But until that day, travel swiftly, be safe, and never, ever trust a {hero.gender=male sultry woman|handsome stranger} you meet alone in a tavern. That bit of common sense has saved the lives of countless adventurers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - PlayerBusy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page NotPhased Text :
"P749038639" "I see that you are not fully dedicated to the quest at hand. I'm afraid that we cannot proceed until you regain your focus and handle whatever side quests you are currently saddled with. The enemy may wait patiently for you in their dread fortress but I will not. Now go quickly, and make haste to accomplish whatever minor tasks are keeping you from helping me save the world."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


