// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : P_NobleSavage 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Noble Savage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1731584901" "Noble Savage"
// ProfessionString :
"P2821360240" "Forlorn Leader"
// DescriptionString :
"P2633284025" "Distraught over his transformation into a cybernetic monstrosity, the Noble Savage has teamed up with Demetrios Vasilikos to help those whose lives were also ruined by Praetor Berry's experiments. He sees himself as the defender of the defenseless, the sheriff of First Ward, and the protector of both the Forlorn and Ghouls alike. He will not rest until justice has been done, and Praetor Berry pays for his crimes against humanity. But one thing at a time, for now he has to concentrate on keeping his people safe."
// InteractionRequiresText :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P124415953" "How's it going, {HeroName}?"
// HelloString :
"P1919719531" "You've got some time?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P342794553" "Go find some other friends in First Ward, I've had enough loyalties betrayed for one lifetime, alright?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P4160631207" "{HeroName}! Between you and me, I'm not sure what to make of all this. First, Demetrios' death gives me leadership of the Forlorn, and now the Palatine of the Compound appoints me as its new Hetman. Had you heard that? The 'new Hetman' bit, I mean. The <i>last</i>  time my kind had made an alliance with those that opposed the Emperor's regime...<br><br>...let's just say it didn't end well. We found ourselves trading one kind of enslavement for another. But this - this feels different."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2542779596" "I could give you something to do, {HeroName}, but I'm of a mind that you're not tough enough to tackle it. Come back a little later and we'll see. Maybe hit the gym, you know?"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2572011076" "Now don't get all misty-eyed when I say this, {HeroName}, but you're all right in my book. Granted, I hear the movie's better, but...well, yeah. You know what I'm trying to say. Come on, we've got more stuff to do."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3031570338" "{HeroName}, there is a reason that my...people call themselves the Forlorn. Even in the armpit of Cole's regime, where there's a monster around every corner, we're often looked on as the worst of 'em all. And we can't forget what we did back when we were...when we were rabid...so sometimes, at your worst, you start to believe the rest of the Warders. Look, I'm embarrassing myself. Your actions here in the gumbo have given the Forlorn some hope. I just wanted you to know that."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P3097944637" "Noble Savage has taken up watch along the walls, looking to resupply what was lost in the recent coup."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2166876143" "I am glad, for I fear his new duties as the Hetman of the Compound have nearly overwhelmed him."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1775998717" "Let me know when you're ready to meet up with Katie again."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NoTasksRemaining 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Phased Text :
"P4039441215" "<color orange>You're unable to reach Noble Savage.</color>"
// Page NotPhased Text :
"P2573830587" "I can't of anything else you can do for me, {HeroName}. You've done plenty already."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - PlayerBusy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page NotPhased Text :
"P1930573273" "Look, {HeroName}, I appreciate you asking, but it looks like you're running yourself ragged doing stuff for other people. Get back to me when you can focus."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


