// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : P_Palatine 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Palatine 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2740776632" "Palatine"
// ProfessionString :
"P1980314991" "Sovereign of the Compound"
// DescriptionString :
"P3467890581" "The appointed sovereign of the Survivor Compound in First Ward, Anna Palatine’s title has been ignored by the Hetman, except for when it has suited his aims."
// InteractionRequiresText :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P4253678533" "{HeroName}, it is good to see you again. The Compound is still beset upon by forces both known and unknown. All of First Ward is awry. What do you seek?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
// FirstVisitString :
"P1856388479" "{HeroName}! I was hoping you would show up. My throne is still considered the lipservice of a dead madman, but here in First Ward, that is sometimes enough. I can only do so much as Palatine of the Compound until I have solidified my position in the eyes of the people.<br><br>The Hetman rattles his saber so loudly that no one dares oppose him directly. He allows my signature only on mundane affairs, but that's where my current power stops. I'll need the agency of my friends to do anything more...and there is so very much work to do yet."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P178993029" "I sense that what tasks I would ask of you would be too much for you to bear. Take this not as an insult, for only by your strength and fortitude did I become Palatine. It is by that grace alone that I hesistate, and ask you to return when you command greater dominion on your path into legend."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1137852885" "Though I have called you it before, {HeroName}, my heart in full now demands that I risk its repetition: you are my good, good friend and a boon to all of First Ward."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3685782042" "For all you have done for First Ward and my place in it, {HeroName}, I shall always be in your debt."
// IntroString :
"P3739514597" "Very good, child. She has already taken up residence in the old Monarch's throne room, but the Hetman keeps a watchful eye on her movements. For now, it is <i>he</i> that truly controls the Survivor Compound."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2296117575" "Very good, {HeroName}, because the watercolor regent needs your help desperately."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P456598892" "Shall I inform Noble you are coming?"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NoTasksRemaining 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Phased Text :
"P1997812809" "<color orange>You're unable to reach the Palatine.</color>"
// Page NotPhased Text :
"P1388158704" "I have nothing left to ask of you, my friend."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - PlayerBusy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page NotPhased Text :
"P3234317063" "What, running a township of your own, now, are you? You're spinning as many plates as I am, at the moment. Come back to me when you aren't so busy."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


