// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1514017479" "Vickers"
// ProfessionString :
"P1669283282" "Last Worder Enforcer"
// DescriptionString :
"P4068483765" "Vickers, or just Vic, is a long time <i>resident</i> of the First Ward. The lessons he learned the hard way are now common knowledge to the Last Worders and Vickers is constantly seeing to the safety and wellbeing of those in the compound. He has nothing but enmity for the Dregs and D.U.S.T. soldiers who make the gumbo their hunting ground, and the innocents their prey."
// InteractionRequiresText :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P3789725268" "It never does get dull around here."
// HelloString :
"P1725549368" "There's only one thing I really miss; cold beer."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P4094067925" "You'll excuse me if I'm a bit stonefaced around you, but I haven't heard anything about who you are or what you're doing here. Let me do a little checking around and then maybe we'll talk."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2938434147" "The name's Vickers, just Vickers, but people here in the gumbo have taken to calling me Vic for short. It's good to make your acquaintance, {HeroName}. Let's say we get to work?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P33375427" "You're gonna have to give me a minute to ponder some. I ain't used to having nothing left to do around here. Let me sit a spell and I'll come up with somethin' that needs doin'."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1910386397" "{Hero.gender=male Boy|Girl}, you've got too much to think about already for me to saddle you up with another job. Besides, I want this one done in a timely fashion, so go take care of your other tasks and come back later. I got some others that can handle this bit of business until then."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3495796907" "Ho boy! I'm not sayin' you aren't tough, {HeroName}, just that you might not be tough enough yet to deal with what I need dealin' with. See me again when you've toughened up a bit more, then we can deal."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3412707196" "I knew one day I'd meet someone worth the boots they were wearin' here in the gumbo, and you're it, {HeroName}. I don't like most people, but you, you're alright."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P817016878" "Makin' enemies in the gumbo is easy, {HeroName}, it's makin' true friends that is hard. You run into trouble, I got your back."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
