// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : P_VanessaDeVore 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Vanessa DeVore 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1920779758" "Vanessa DeVore"
// ProfessionString :
"P2361583834" "Leader of the Carnival of Light"
// DescriptionString :
"P370760792" "The mysterious Vanessa DeVore is a powerful psychic who formed the Carnival of Light from the desperate remaining sorcerers and renegade telepaths who saw Emperor Cole for the evil he truly is. It is her mental powers which mask the Resistance from Praetor Tilman and the Seers. She helped form the Resistance from scattered and aimless groups opposed to Emperor Cole's totalitarian regime. She chose Calvin Scott to lead the violence-prone Crusaders into battle against the Praetorian usurpers, while with the other hand she has carefully cultivated the Wardens to overthrow the empire from within and ultimately inherit it as their charge."
// InteractionRequiresText :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P1232768992" "{HeroName}, I'm afraid there is no time for pleasantries. The Talons of Vengeance are moving with purpose... Serene's purpose, and I'm afraid that we may already be too late to stop her. I hope you can prove my fears wrong."
// HelloString :
"P2875269310" "We are fated to work together, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P3878400668" "I have awaited this moment for a long time, {HeroName}. We are about to do great things, you and I."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3414506320" "Our paths do not merge for some time, {HeroName}. When it is time for them to do so then you will come to see me and the moment will match my visions. Only then can we work together, for to do so prematurely could ruin everything I have foreseen."
// FirstVisitString :
"P235673673" "As I foresaw so long ago, our paths have finally merged, {HeroName}. Now that I have context for that vision, so much more makes sense, and there is little time left to do much about it. I hope you are ready to work hard, because everything Serene has done we must undo, and quickly, or all will be lost."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2884405153" "You have done all that fate required of you, {HeroName}, and no other visions suggest that our relationship continue past this point. Do not take it personally. I have foreseen many things and many faces and each requires my attention in turn. Our fates were intertwined and now they are again free. Find your new path and walk it proudly, for in your future I see great and wonderous things."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P44304216" "The fate strings tangle about you in impossible patterns. This moment was not foreseen. You will need to complete some of your tasks with others before I can read our fates once more."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3670553049" "The time is not yet right, {HeroName}. You lack the strength that I have foreseen in my dreams. Go, grow stronger, and you will return to me when the time is right."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1440213900" "I have had waking dreams of this moment before, {HeroName}. I saw long ago that you and I would be great friends and that moment is here and now.<br><br>If you ever need my guidance, just think of me, and I will answer."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3035774213" "It is difficult for me to grow close to anyone, {HeroName}. I have foreseen the moment of death for all I am fated to meet... except my own. But I have foreseen through you that when my time comes, you are near, and I am in your thoughts, and that is comforting."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P3816543649" "Vanessa DeVore has graced my presence with her mental caresses. She asked for you by name."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


